# Arcana env-var index.
#
# The canonical, per-app templates live elsewhere — copy them:
#
#   Backend  →  cp infra/env/local.env.example  api/.env
#   Frontend →  cp web/.env.local.example       web/.env.local
#
# See docs/env_generation_guide.md for the full guide (every variable,
# where to obtain each credential, and the minimum keys for each milestone).
#
# Secrets are NEVER committed (NFR-SEC-03). The hook in
# .claude/hooks/check_secrets.py blocks accidental commits.
